      "category": 1,
      "description": "Four-on-the-floor kick driving the demo. Acts as the sidechain SOURCE for both Pad and Bass — every quarter-note hit triggers ducking on the sustained instruments. Plays on bars 5–16 (beats 16–64); silent in intro and outro so the listener can hear pad alone for A/B comparison.",
