      "velocity_filter_sensitivity": 0.0,
      "patch": {
        "name": "Kick",
        "version": "1.0",
        "description": "Classic synth kick: sine osc (50 Hz) shaped by two envelopes. Pitch envelope (Decay 50 ms, curve -0.6) drives the oscillator's linear FM input for a downward \"thump\" sweep. Amp envelope (Decay 350 ms, curve -0.5, Sustain 0) gives the punchy decay. No effects in the chain — kept clean so it works well as a sidechain trigger source (peak content, not sustained energy).",
