      "transpose": 0.0,
      "oversampling": 1,
      "category": 3,
      "description": "Sustained Cm7 pad held across the entire song. Acts as a sidechain RECEIVER (sidechain_source_id = 1, the Kick). When the kick hits during bars 5–16, the compressor ducks the pad ≈10 dB; release 220 ms allows the pad to breathe back up between kicks. In intro/outro the pad plays uncompressed because the kick is silent (no sidechain signal).",
