      "stealing_strategy": "Oldest",
      "max_voices": 8,
      "velocity_amp_sensitivity": 1.0,
      "velocity_filter_sensitivity": 0.0,
      "sidechain_source_id": 1,
      "patch": {
        "name": "Pad",
        "version": "1.0",
        "description": "Warm detuned saw pad: two saw oscillators with unison (5 voices + 3 voices, detune 12 ct and 6 ct, spread 0.8/0.5) mixed and fed through a lowpass filter (cutoff 2200 Hz, light resonance, 30% key tracking). Slow attack (600 ms) + long release (1.5 s) for an airy sustained character. Effect chain: Compressor with sidechain enabled (threshold -18 dB, ratio 6, attack 3 ms, release 220 ms, SC HPF at 20 Hz to let the full kick spectrum trigger detection).",
